# Spring Data REST

This module adds [Spring Data REST](https://spring.io/projects/spring-data-rest) to expose your Spring Data JPA repositories as REST endpoints.

## Dependencies

- `spring-boot-starter-data-rest`: Spring Data REST starter
- `spring-data-rest-hal-explorer`: web UI to browse the exposed APIs (runtime only)

## Configuration

The following properties are set in the application configuration:

```properties
spring.data.rest.base-path=/api
spring.data.rest.detection-strategy=annotated
spring.data.rest.default-page-size=20
spring.data.rest.max-page-size=100
```

With the `annotated` detection strategy, only the repositories annotated with `@RepositoryRestResource` are exposed.

`RestConfiguration` uses plain JSON (instead of HAL) as default media type and returns the body on create and update.
